<title>NORWAY: Elkem buys Brazilian chrome ore mine.</title>
<headline>Elkem buys Brazilian chrome ore mine.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian metals producer Elkem ASA said on Monday it had bought the chrome ore activities of Brazil's Caemi Group.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Elkem will take over an ore mine and the related licence rights in the Vila Nova region in Amapa state in northeast Brazil.</p>
<p>The acquisition forms part of the company's strategy to ensure Elem Rana long-term chrome ore reserves, Elkem said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
